  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Mount Elgon Regional Ecosystem Conservation       Programme (MERECP LVBC)</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Mount Elgon Regional Ecosystem Conservation       Programme (MERECP LVBC)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">M&#xE5;let med programmet &#xE4;r</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The aim of MERECP is to enhance the conservation status and benefits of Mt Elgon ecosystem for environment quality and livelihoods. MERECP will address the necessity for effective management of a trans- boundary shared resource in a holistic and participatory manner. MERECP will link environmental management to livelihood security and poverty alleviation as well as conflict resolution.</narrative>
  </description>
